# Random values against pycrate and asn1c. asn1c agrees with ours on every
# value. pycrate cannot decode a container whose IE has an open type of 16K
# octets or more (fragmented, X.691 11.9.3.8) followed by another IE: it
# cannot read back its own encoding of [IE(16383 octets), IE(0 octets)] or
# [IE(20000), IE(3)], which ours writes byte for byte as pycrate does.
# asn1c decodes the content of an IE of an id it does not know as <absent>
# and does not print it (xcheck counts those apart).
deviates pycrate Msg
